@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="container py-5" style="max-width:780px">
    <p>
        ElevateWorkforce is committed to protecting the privacy of job seekers, employers and administrators who use our platform.
        This policy explains what information we collect, how we use it and the choices you have.
    </p>
    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-2">Information we collect</h4>
    <p>
        When you create an account, we collect your name, email address and the account type you choose. Job seekers may optionally
        provide professional details and upload a resume. Employers provide company information and job listings.
    </p>
    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-2">How we use information</h4>
    <p>
        We use this information to match candidates with opportunities, power the recruitment workflow and enable administrator
        verification. Resumes are only shared with employers after a candidate applies to a role.
    </p>
    <h4 class="mt-4 mb-2">Data security</h4>
    <p>
        Your resume and profile data are stored securely and are never exposed publicly. Only authorised users with the correct
        role and ownership can access private data. This is an academic project; treat demo data as non-sensitive.
    </p>
</div>